msgstr "Noggrannhetsfaktor (2 låg till 10 hög):"

#: ../share/extensions/other/gcodetools/gcodetools_engraving.inx:12
msgid "Draw additional graphics to see engraving path"
msgstr "Rita ytterligare grafik för att se graveringsbanan"

#: ../share/extensions/other/gcodetools/gcodetools_engraving.inx:14
msgid ""
"\n"
"This function creates path to engrave letters or any shape with sharp "
"angles.\n"
"Cutter's depth as a function of radius is defined by the tool.\n"
"Depth may be any Python expression. For instance:\n"
"\n"
"cone....(45 degrees)......................: w\n"
"cone....(height/diameter=10/3)..: 10*w/3\n"
"sphere..(radius r)...........................: math.sqrt(max(0,r**2-w**2))\n"
"ellipse.(minor axis r, major 4r).....: math.sqrt(max(0,r**2-w**2))*4"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Denna funktion skapar en bana för att gravera bokstäver eller andra former "
"med\n"
"skarpa vinklar. Skärets djup som en funktion av radien definieras av "
"verktyget.\n"
"Djupet kan vara vilket Python-uttryck som helst. Till exempel:\n"
"\n"
"cone....(45 grader)......................: w\n"
"cone....(höjd/diameter=10/3)..: 10*w/3\n"
"sfär..(radie r)...........................: math.sqrt(max(0,r**2-w**2))\n"
"ellips.(mindre axel r, större 4r).....: math.sqrt(max(0,r**2-w**2))*4"

