#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:3
msgid "Optimized SVG Output"
msgstr "Optimerad SVG-utmatning"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 10
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:10
msgid "Number of significant digits for coordinates:"
msgstr "Antal signifikanta siffror för koordinater:"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:10
msgid ""
"Specifies the number of significant digits that should be output for "
"coordinates. Note that significant digits are *not* the number of decimals "
"but the overall number of digits in the output. For example if a value of "
"\"3\" is specified, the coordinate 3.14159 is output as 3.14 while the "
"coordinate 123.675 is output as 124."
msgstr ""
"Anger antalet signifikanta siffror som ska matas ut för koordinater. "
"Observera att signifikanta siffror *inte* är antalet decimaler utan det "
"totala antalet siffror i utdata. Om t.ex. värdet \"3\" anges kommer "
"koordinaten 3,14159 att visas som 3,14 medan koordinaten 123,675 visas som "
"124."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:14
msgid "Shorten color values"
msgstr "Förkorta färgvärden"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 14
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:14
msgid ""
"Convert all color specifications to #RRGGBB (or #RGB where applicable) "
"format."
msgstr ""
"Konvertera alla färgspecifikationer till formatet #RRGGBB (eller #RGB där så "
"är tillämpligt)."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:17
msgid "Convert CSS attributes to XML attributes"
msgstr "Konvertera CSS-attribut till XML-attribut"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:17
msgid ""
"Convert styles from style tags and inline style=\"\" declarations into XML "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
"Konvertera stilar från stiltaggar och inline style=\"\"-deklarationer till "
"XML-attribut."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:21
msgid "Collapse groups"
msgstr "Fäll ut grupper"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:21
msgid ""
"Remove useless groups, promoting their contents up one level. Requires "
"\"Remove unused IDs\" to be set."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort oanvändbara grupper och flytta upp innehållet i dem en nivå. Kräver "
"att \"Ta bort oanvända ID:n\" är inställt."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:24
msgid "Create groups for similar attributes"
msgstr "Skapa grupper för liknande attribut"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 24
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:24
msgid ""
"Create groups for runs of elements having at least one attribute in common "
"(e.g. fill-color, stroke-opacity, ...)."
msgstr ""
"Skapa grupper för körningar av element som har minst ett attribut gemensamt "
"(t.ex. fill-color, stroke-opacity, ...)."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:28
msgid "Keep editor data"
msgstr "Behåll redigerardata"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 28
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:28
msgid ""
"Don't remove editor-specific elements and attributes. Currently supported: "
"Inkscape, Sodipodi and Adobe Illustrator."
msgstr ""
"Ta inte bort redigerarspecifika element och attribut. Stöds för närvarande: "
"Inkscape, Sodipodi och Adobe Illustrator."

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 31
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:31
msgid "Keep unreferenced definitions"
msgstr "Behåll icke-refererade definitioner"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 31
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:31
msgid "Keep element definitions that are not currently used in the SVG"
msgstr "Behåll elementdefinitioner som för närvarande inte används i SVG"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 35
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:35
msgid "Work around renderer bugs"
msgstr "Temporär lösning för renderingsbuggar"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 35
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:35
msgid ""
"Works around some common renderer bugs (mainly libRSVG) at the cost of a "
"slightly larger SVG file."
msgstr ""
"Temporär lösning för några vanliga renderingsbuggar (främst libRSVG) på "
"bekostnad av en något större SVG-fil."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:38
msgid "Document options"
msgstr "Dokumentalternativ"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:41
msgid "Remove the XML declaration"
msgstr "Ta bort XML-deklarationen"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 41
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:41
msgid ""
"Removes the XML declaration (which is optional but should be provided, "
"especially if special characters are used in the document) from the file "
"header."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort XML-deklarationen (som är valfri men bör anges, särskilt om "
"specialtecken används i dokumentet) från filhuvudet."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:44
msgid "Remove metadata"
msgstr "Ta bort metadata"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 44
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:44
msgid ""
"Remove metadata tags along with all the contained information, which may "
"include license and author information, alternate versions for non-SVG-"
"enabled browsers, etc."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort metadatataggar tillsammans med all information, som kan innehålla "
"licens- och upphovsinformation, alternativa versioner för icke-SVG-"
"aktiverade webbläsare etc."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:47
msgid "Remove comments"
msgstr "Ta bort kommentarer"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 47
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:47
msgid "Remove all XML comments from output."
msgstr "Ta bort alla XML-kommentarer från utmatning."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:50
msgid "Embed raster images"
msgstr "Bädda in rasterbilder"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 50
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:50
msgid ""
"Resolve external references to raster images and embed them as Base64-"
"encoded data URLs."
msgstr ""
"Slå upp externa referenser till rasterbilder och bädda in dem som Base64-"
"kodade data-URL:er."

#. TODO
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:53
msgid "Enable viewboxing"
msgstr "Aktivera viewboxing"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 53
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:53
msgid ""
"Set page size to 100%/100% (full width and height of the display area) and "
"introduce a viewBox specifying the drawings dimensions."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in sidstorleken på 100%/100% (full bredd och höjd på visningsområdet) "
"och inför en viewBox som anger ritningarnas mått."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:55
msgid "Pretty-printing"
msgstr "Vackert tryck"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 58
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:58
msgid "Format output with line-breaks and indentation"
msgstr "Formatera utmatning med radbrytning och indragning"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 58
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:58
msgid ""
"Produce nicely formatted output including line-breaks. If you do not intend "
"to hand-edit the SVG file you can disable this option to bring down the file "
"size even more at the cost of clarity."
msgstr ""
"Producerar snyggt formaterad utdata inklusive radbrytningar. Om du inte "
"tänker handredigera SVG-filen kan du inaktivera det här alternativet för att "
"minska filstorleken ännu mer på bekostnad av tydligheten."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:61
msgid "Indentation characters:"
msgstr "Indragningstecken:"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:61
msgid ""
"The type of indentation used for each level of nesting in the output. "
"Specify \"None\" to disable indentation. This option has no effect if "
"\"Format output with line-breaks and indentation\" is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Den typ av indragning som används för varje nivå av nestning i utdata. Ange "
"\"Ingen\" för att inaktivera indragning. Detta alternativ har ingen effekt "
"om \"Formatera utmatning med radbrytning och indragning” är inaktiverat."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:62
msgid "Space"
msgstr "Mellanslag"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:63
msgid "Tab"
msgstr "Tabb"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:64
msgctxt "Indent"
msgid "None"
msgstr "Ingen"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:68
msgid "Depth of indentation:"
msgstr "Djupet för indragningen:"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:68
msgid ""
"The depth of the chosen type of indentation. E.g. if you choose \"2\" every "
"nesting level in the output will be indented by two additional spaces/tabs."
msgstr ""
"Djupet på den valda typen av indragning. Om du t.ex. väljer \"2\" kommer "
"varje nestningsnivå i utmatningen att vara indragen med ytterligare två "
"mellanslag/tabbar."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:71
msgid "Strip the \"xml:space\" attribute from the root SVG element"
msgstr "Avlägsna attributet \"xml:space\" från SVG-elementets rot"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:71
msgid ""
"This is useful if the input file specifies \"xml:space='preserve'\" in the "
"root SVG element which instructs the SVG editor not to change whitespace in "
"the document at all (and therefore overrides the options above)."
msgstr ""
"Detta är användbart om inmatningsfilen anger \"xml:space='preserve'\" i SVG-"
"rodelementet, vilket instruerar SVG-redigeraren att inte ändra blanksteg i "
"dokumentet alls (och därför åsidosätter alternativen ovan)."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:73
msgid "IDs"
msgstr "IDn"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:76
msgid "Remove unused IDs"
msgstr "Ta bort oanvända ID:n"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 76
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:76
msgid ""
"Remove all unreferenced IDs from elements. Those are not needed for "
"rendering."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort alla icke-refererade ID:n från element. De behövs inte för rendering."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:80
msgid "Shorten IDs"
msgstr "Förkorta IDs"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:80
msgid ""
"Minimize the length of IDs using only lowercase letters, assigning the "
"shortest values to the most-referenced elements. For instance, "
"\"linearGradient5621\" will become \"a\" if it is the most used element."
msgstr ""
"Minimera längden på ID:n genom att endast använda gemener och tilldela de "
"kortaste värdena till de mest refererade elementen. Till exempel blir "
"\"linearGradient5621\" \"a\" om det är det mest använda elementet."

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 83
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:83
msgid "Prefix shortened IDs with:"
msgstr "Prefixa förkortade ID:n med:"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 83
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:83
msgid "Prepend shortened IDs with the specified prefix."
msgstr "Inled förkortade ID:n med det angivna prefixet."

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 87
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:87
msgid "Preserve manually created IDs not ending with digits"
msgstr "Bevara manuellt skapade ID:n som inte slutar med siffror"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 87
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:87
msgid ""
"Descriptive IDs which were manually created to reference or label specific "
"elements or groups (e.g. #arrowStart, #arrowEnd or #textLabels) will be "
"preserved while numbered IDs (as they are generated by most SVG editors "
"including Inkscape) will be removed/shortened."
msgstr ""
"Beskrivande ID:n som skapades manuellt för att referera till eller märka "
"specifika element eller grupper (t.ex. #arrowStart, #arrowEnd eller "
"#textLabels) kommer att bevaras medan numrerade ID:n (som de genereras av de "
"flesta SVG-redigerare, inklusive Inkscape) kommer att tas bort/förkortas."

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 90
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:90
msgid "Preserve the following IDs:"
msgstr "Bevara följande ID:n:"

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 90
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:90
msgid "A comma-separated list of IDs that are to be preserved."
msgstr "En kommaseparerad lista med ID:n som ska bevaras."

#.
#. File: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx, line: 93
#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:93
msgid "Preserve IDs starting with:"
msgstr "Bevara ID:n som börjar med:"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:93
msgid ""
"Preserve all IDs that start with the specified prefix (e.g. specify \"flag\" "
"to preserve \"flag-mx\", \"flag-pt\", etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Bevara alla ID:n som börjar med det angivna prefixet (ange t.ex. \"flag\" "
"för att bevara \"flag-mx\", \"flag-pt\" etc.)."

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:101
msgid "Optimized SVG Output is provided by"
msgstr "Optimerad SVG-utmatning tillhandahålls av"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:102
msgid "Scour - An SVG Scrubber"
msgstr "Scour - En SVG-skrubbare"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:104
msgid "For details please refer to"
msgstr "För mer information, se"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:105
msgid "https://github.com/scour-project/scour"
msgstr "https://github.com/scour-project/scour"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:110
msgid "This version of the extension is designed for"
msgstr "Denna version av tillägget är utformad för"

#: ../share/extensions/output_scour.inx:111
